Dialogue: 69,0:01:12.54,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 69,0:01:18.01,0:01:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No stalling, keep it moving.
Dialogue: 69,0:01:20.65,0:01:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just two more points.
Dialogue: 69,0:01:41.62,0:01:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If the brilliance of table tennis is like a flash of white lightning,
Dialogue: 69,0:01:53.01,0:01:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruozhi! Get it together!
Dialogue: 69,0:01:55.22,0:01:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,0:02:12.09,0:02:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}then during that match,
Dialogue: 69,0:02:15.66,0:02:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ruozhi! Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,0:02:17.02,0:02:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my lightning fizzled out.
Dialogue: 69,0:02:23.21,0:02:23.25,Default,chapter,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:33.97,songs,,0,0,0,,We yearn for a distant sky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:52.07,songs,,0,0,0,,Worn down heels and retied shoelaces
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:57.99,songs,,0,0,0,,Times passes by linked by a step's length
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:03.62,songs,,0,0,0,,Falling down, having a cry, getting up and laughing again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:07.92,songs,,0,0,0,,My heart waits for a day that is yet to come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:15.09,songs,,0,0,0,,Losing something gets you closer to a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:19.01,songs,,0,0,0,,"We'll get stronger each time we're torn"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.01,0:03:25.39,songs,,0,0,0,,That's our oath, so we won't lose our way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:29.27,songs,,0,0,0,,How ever many, how ever many dozens of attempts
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.27,0:03:32.57,songs,,0,0,0,,We want to stand tall in our youth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:37.78,songs,,0,0,0,,You're the one who decides where your goal is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:43.62,songs,,0,0,0,,Don't be bound by the past, don't wait for tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:45.75,songs,,0,0,0,,Who I am in this moment
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.75,0:03:50.75,songs,,0,0,0,,Is who I want to love being
Dialogue: 69,0:04:05.31,0:04:05.35,Default,chapter,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 69,0:04:15.89,0:04:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's August 31st, the start of the new school year.
Dialogue: 69,0:04:19.49,0:04:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wonder if all the children slept well last night.
Dialogue: 69,0:04:22.45,0:04:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Forget the kids, the parents probably didn't get a wink of sleep.
Dialogue: 69,0:04:26.48,0:04:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}True!
Dialogue: 69,0:04:27.82,0:04:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They've got to think about what to pack for the first day, what to do for breakfast,
Dialogue: 69,0:04:31.43,0:04:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and whether they should get to school a bit early.
Dialogue: 69,0:04:34.60,0:04:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Exactly.
Dialogue: 69,0:04:35.74,0:04:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't forget to bring your homework, kids!
Dialogue: 69,0:05:33.27,0:05:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tomorrow may be September, but it won't feel like autumn in the slightest.
Dialogue: 69,0:05:37.49,0:05:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}These muggy days will continue for a while yet.
Dialogue: 69,0:05:42.27,0:05:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Breakfast is served!
Dialogue: 69,0:05:44.36,0:05:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you hot wearing all that?
Dialogue: 69,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have some pork buns.
Dialogue: 69,0:05:47.72,0:05:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's grandpa?
Dialogue: 69,0:05:48.62,0:05:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He left early, something about wanting to join the yangko dance.
Dialogue: 69,0:05:54.24,0:05:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to make all this.
Dialogue: 69,0:05:56.97,0:05:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your first day, so I made all your favourites.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:00.37,0:06:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:01.97,0:06:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it. You need to fuel up in the morning,
Dialogue: 69,0:06:05.68,0:06:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can go to school to study, pong, make friends—
Dialogue: 69,0:06:10.36,0:06:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, eat.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:20.73,0:06:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They get along now, but they used to fight every day.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:25.52,0:06:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:27.27,0:06:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll set up a table in the garden later.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a bat!
Dialogue: 69,0:06:31.22,0:06:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gramps won't give me the time of day because I'm bad.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:35.74,0:06:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave that for me.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:37.85,0:06:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a few for the road.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:39.93,0:06:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm full.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:41.89,0:06:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Ruozhi, I'll drop you off.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:43.87,0:06:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. See you later.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:47.71,0:06:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,See you. Stay safe out there.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:49.65,0:06:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 69,0:06:51.93,0:06:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, school's that way!
Dialogue: 69,0:07:00.50,0:07:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I got it all cleaned up for nothing.
Dialogue: 69,0:07:08.25,0:07:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 69,0:07:16.79,0:07:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,First day of school.
Dialogue: 69,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Our friendly trio made it to campus in good spirits!
Dialogue: 69,0:07:23.93,0:07:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I get cut off?
Dialogue: 69,0:07:25.29,0:07:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some faith in me.
Dialogue: 69,0:07:27.56,0:07:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going, Lu is waiting.
Dialogue: 69,0:07:29.80,0:07:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 69,0:07:30.42,0:07:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 69,0:07:40.00,0:07:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,303... But that's Din Tai Fung?
Dialogue: 69,0:07:42.71,0:07:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaolongbaos ready to go!
Dialogue: 69,0:07:46.97,0:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to papa!
Dialogue: 69,0:07:54.01,0:07:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the guys' dorm.
Dialogue: 69,0:07:56.10,0:07:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we shooting for?
Dialogue: 69,0:07:58.00,0:07:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Number one in China!
Dialogue: 69,0:08:04.98,0:08:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Qiming High Manga Society!
Dialogue: 69,0:08:08.22,0:08:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 69,0:08:16.92,0:08:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the map wrong?
Dialogue: 69,0:08:25.47,0:08:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 69,0:08:27.66,0:08:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 69,0:08:31.39,0:08:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I startle you?
Dialogue: 69,0:08:35.68,0:08:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you bring that back? 2nd floor.
Dialogue: 69,0:08:44.64,0:08:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,0:08:45.59,0:08:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 69,0:08:52.80,0:08:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 69,0:08:58.60,0:09:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck was that?
Dialogue: 69,0:09:22.92,0:09:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,0:09:24.48,0:09:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's in our class?
Dialogue: 69,0:09:26.97,0:09:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Wang Lu?
Dialogue: 69,0:09:28.17,0:09:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's super smart. She had the highest grades in middle school.
Dialogue: 69,0:09:31.11,0:09:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a genius to me.
Dialogue: 69,0:09:33.92,0:09:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Being in the same class is gonna be rough.
Dialogue: 69,0:09:36.72,0:09:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How come? It'd be great to ask her for help.
Dialogue: 69,0:09:40.62,0:09:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Class 9! We're taking attendance now!
Dialogue: 69,0:09:44.48,0:09:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push! Line up!
Dialogue: 69,0:09:47.06,0:09:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach is running late so I'll take attendance.
Dialogue: 69,0:09:50.24,0:09:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Chao?
Dialogue: 69,0:09:51.40,0:09:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 69,0:09:53.66,0:09:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Wang Lu?
Dialogue: 69,0:09:58.91,0:10:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 69,0:10:01.17,0:10:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! My bad.
Dialogue: 69,0:10:03.59,0:10:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 69,0:10:04.42,0:10:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry. I stepped on your foot.
Dialogue: 69,0:10:08.17,0:10:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 69,0:10:11.81,0:10:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that—
Dialogue: 69,0:10:12.70,0:10:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 69,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 69,0:10:17.41,0:10:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Xintong.
Dialogue: 69,0:10:22.85,0:10:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi.
Dialogue: 69,0:10:24.47,0:10:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Zhang Ruozhi.
Dialogue: 69,0:10:28.36,0:10:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 69,0:10:38.22,0:10:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You need something?
Dialogue: 69,0:10:40.61,0:10:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you good here?
Dialogue: 69,0:10:52.52,0:10:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that's looking a bit tense.
Dialogue: 69,0:10:55.80,0:10:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 69,0:10:57.60,0:10:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly what she said.
Dialogue: 69,0:11:04.22,0:11:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 69,0:11:07.13,0:11:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about hitting your forehead.
Dialogue: 69,0:11:16.02,0:11:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That was you?
Dialogue: 69,0:11:18.37,0:11:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I have another one, actually.
Dialogue: 69,0:11:21.52,0:11:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Might be better to use both.
Dialogue: 69,0:11:27.46,0:11:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yikes, I can practically see the sparks.
Dialogue: 69,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where?{This one's a brainlet}{this one?}{based retorn}
Dialogue: 69,0:11:32.61,0:11:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,On Lu's face!
Dialogue: 69,0:11:35.02,0:11:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Her face?
Dialogue: 69,0:11:41.20,0:11:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get moving.
Dialogue: 69,0:11:43.01,0:11:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm handing out the textbooks after attendance.{shortened for CPS}{I'm going to hand out the textbooks after we've taken attendance.}
Dialogue: 69,0:11:46.80,0:11:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you all waiting for?
Dialogue: 69,0:11:50.96,0:11:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, everyone.
Dialogue: 69,0:11:52.68,0:11:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your homeroom teacher, Li Wencan.
Dialogue: 69,0:11:56.58,0:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you all.
Dialogue: 69,0:11:58.22,0:12:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Class 1-9.
Dialogue: 69,0:12:01.89,0:12:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have some admin tasks to take care of today,
Dialogue: 69,0:12:03.84,0:12:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can use your phones to contact your families,
Dialogue: 69,0:12:06.58,0:12:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but starting tomorrow phones won't be allowed as per school rules.
Dialogue: 69,0:12:10.24,0:12:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like you to focus on your studies.
Dialogue: 69,0:12:13.30,0:12:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our teachers are among the best in the city.
Dialogue: 69,0:12:17.13,0:12:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be sure to support your high school lives.
Dialogue: 69,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever need help with your studies,
Dialogue: 69,0:12:23.24,0:12:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you can come to me whenever you like, even outside of class.
Dialogue: 69,0:12:26.77,0:12:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise to help you in any way I can.
Dialogue: 69,0:12:29.81,0:12:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking care of your health is also an important part of school life.
Dialogue: 69,0:12:32.27,0:12:36.28,signs - watch,,0,0,0,,{Sign}Do you like ping pong?\N — Li Xintong
Dialogue: 69,0:12:34.66,0:12:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We have plenty of extracurricular activities available,
Dialogue: 69,0:12:37.70,0:12:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,so on top of staying fit and healthy, you can broaden your horizons,
Dialogue: 69,0:12:41.01,0:12:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,make friends with similar interests, and—
Dialogue: 69,0:12:56.90,0:12:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's this new dessert shop.
Dialogue: 69,0:12:59.12,0:13:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The tiramisu is amazing! \NLet's stop by after school.
Dialogue: 69,0:13:07.36,0:13:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh!
Dialogue: 69,0:13:08.63,0:13:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a Champion Road series racket case, isn't it?
Dialogue: 69,0:13:12.60,0:13:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never get my hands on one!
Dialogue: 69,0:13:15.57,0:13:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. My sister gave it to me.
Dialogue: 69,0:13:22.72,0:13:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, now it makes sense.
Dialogue: 69,0:13:24.75,0:13:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You like ping pong too? \NMakes sense you'd be good.
Dialogue: 69,0:13:28.59,0:13:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 69,0:13:30.17,0:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Wang Lu plays ping pong too?
Dialogue: 69,0:13:32.62,0:13:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lu was one of the top players in the city during middle school,
Dialogue: 69,0:13:35.60,0:13:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and she was put forward for the national team selection tournament.
Dialogue: 69,0:13:40.29,0:13:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I quit because I got too busy.
Dialogue: 69,0:13:42.64,0:13:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shot this morning was great.
Dialogue: 69,0:13:44.54,0:13:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I must've missed it. Can you do it again?
Dialogue: 69,0:13:49.11,0:13:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a crowd so I had to show off a little.
Dialogue: 69,0:13:53.10,0:13:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Lu! Do it again!
Dialogue: 69,0:13:56.37,0:13:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 69,0:14:02.09,0:14:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys! They're doing something crazy in class 9!
Dialogue: 69,0:14:07.26,0:14:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that {\i1}the{\i0} Wang Lu? What's she doing?
Dialogue: 69,0:14:10.58,0:14:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The heck is that?
Dialogue: 69,0:14:12.21,0:14:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like pong?
Dialogue: 69,0:14:13.84,0:14:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are the cups for?
Dialogue: 69,0:14:15.08,0:14:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell if I know.
Dialogue: 69,0:14:16.28,0:14:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She gonna show off a cool trick or something?
Dialogue: 69,0:14:17.97,0:14:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's smart {\i1}and{\i0} knows how to work a bat? \NCan't ask for much more than that.
Dialogue: 69,0:14:21.00,0:14:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that, she's like a pro!
Dialogue: 69,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She one-shot it!
Dialogue: 68,0:14:43.06,0:14:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your control is amazing!
Dialogue: 69,0:14:44.83,0:14:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That looked even better than this morning!
Dialogue: 69,0:14:47.24,0:14:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not all that.
Dialogue: 69,0:14:49.22,0:14:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She's pretty good.
Dialogue: 69,0:14:50.63,0:14:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard she was on a pro team.
Dialogue: 69,0:14:51.98,0:14:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, there's someone this cracked in our school?
Dialogue: 69,0:14:55.76,0:14:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll post this on Xiaolanshu, yeah?
Dialogue: 69,0:15:22.50,0:15:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Wang Lu! You're amazing!
Dialogue: 69,0:15:24.82,0:15:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 69,0:15:25.55,0:15:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the smart and beautiful ping pong prodigy, Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,0:15:29.62,0:15:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one person in the world of this calibre!
Dialogue: 69,0:15:35.07,0:15:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi, wanna square up?
Dialogue: 69,0:15:39.61,0:15:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't played in a while, so I'm rusty.
Dialogue: 69,0:15:42.50,0:15:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 69,0:15:43.91,0:15:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can colour me surprised.
Dialogue: 69,0:15:46.13,0:15:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand attention seekers.
Dialogue: 69,0:15:49.64,0:15:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 69,0:15:49.92,0:15:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're awesome!
Dialogue: 69,0:15:51.72,0:15:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did you want to play against?
Dialogue: 69,0:15:53.95,0:15:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hi Senpai.
Dialogue: 69,0:15:57.58,0:16:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you put on quite the performance in the gym this morning.
Dialogue: 69,0:16:04.01,0:16:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody was using it so I was teaching them a little.
Dialogue: 69,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nobody was using it"?
Dialogue: 69,0:16:09.90,0:16:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to scout for the table tennis club.
Dialogue: 69,0:16:11.51,0:16:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have one starting this year.
Dialogue: 69,0:16:15.51,0:16:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a table tennis team?
Dialogue: 69,0:16:17.13,0:16:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Never heard that.
Dialogue: 69,0:16:19.52,0:16:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They came to recruit Wang Lu?
Dialogue: 69,0:16:21.04,0:16:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the team play matches?
Dialogue: 69,0:16:25.77,0:16:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well I'd love to join, but they really want me in the student council.
Dialogue: 69,0:16:32.37,0:16:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine, I'm here for Zhang Ruozhi.
Dialogue: 69,0:16:37.30,0:16:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why her?
Dialogue: 69,0:16:39.86,0:16:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the captain, Zhao Siqing.
Dialogue: 69,0:16:42.63,0:16:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The coach asked me to invite you to our club.
Dialogue: 69,0:16:45.25,0:16:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 69,0:16:51.93,0:16:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you being a bit too humble?
Dialogue: 69,0:16:54.17,0:16:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You were top 8 in the provincial selection tournament.{yea lu is cooked}
Dialogue: 69,0:17:00.24,0:17:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 69,0:17:02.82,0:17:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't that like super duper amazing?
Dialogue: 69,0:17:06.26,0:17:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who's better.
Dialogue: 69,0:17:08.33,0:17:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't Wang Lu say she wanted a match?
Dialogue: 69,0:17:13.99,0:17:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You were going to play? Great!
Dialogue: 69,0:17:17.32,0:17:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be good advertising for our club.
Dialogue: 69,0:17:19.47,0:17:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You all better come watch!
Dialogue: 69,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And sign up, while you're at it!
Dialogue: 69,0:17:24.49,0:17:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's talented players all around.
Dialogue: 69,0:17:26.96,0:17:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The really good players are modest, huh?
Dialogue: 69,0:17:29.54,0:17:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the provincial selection special?
Dialogue: 69,0:17:31.49,0:17:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 69,0:17:32.53,0:17:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even begin to compare them to city-level tournaments.
Dialogue: 69,0:17:36.16,0:17:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry!{is this a flashback?}
Dialogue: 69,0:17:37.39,0:17:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My bad.
Dialogue: 69,0:17:40.20,0:17:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you good here?
Dialogue: 69,0:17:46.12,0:17:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me how good you are.
Dialogue: 69,0:17:48.40,0:17:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll settle this on the table.
Dialogue: 69,0:18:08.24,0:18:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is exciting!
Dialogue: 69,0:18:08.24,0:18:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta get a good spot!
Dialogue: 69,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's our team's poster.
Dialogue: 69,0:18:12.16,0:18:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Table Tennis: Our Glorious National Sport!
Dialogue: 69,0:18:14.27,0:18:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A professional coach will guide you along the way.
Dialogue: 69,0:18:17.96,0:18:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lame...
Dialogue: 69,0:18:22.42,0:18:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this to us!
Dialogue: 69,0:18:33.80,0:18:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what a real poster looks like!
Dialogue: 69,0:18:42.26,0:18:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one game before I go to student council.
Dialogue: 69,0:18:44.85,0:18:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 69,0:19:10.90,0:19:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! She's in the lead!
Dialogue: 69,0:19:13.01,0:19:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Send her packing!
Dialogue: 69,0:19:14.51,0:19:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,0:19:26.90,0:19:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Go Zhang Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,0:19:46.04,0:19:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nailed her second point!
Dialogue: 69,0:19:47.27,0:19:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking good!
Dialogue: 69,0:19:48.09,0:19:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,0:19:50.72,0:19:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They both forehand like Ma Long!
Dialogue: 69,0:19:54.53,0:19:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Rouzhi's trajectory is low and stable, and Wang Lu is—
Dialogue: 69,0:19:59.05,0:20:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 69,0:20:06.67,0:20:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice smash!
Dialogue: 69,0:20:06.67,0:20:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}She did it!
Dialogue: 69,0:20:08.59,0:20:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ackshually{\i0}, that was a forehand loop!{took the words right out of my mouth}
Dialogue: 69,0:20:11.73,0:20:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You accelerate quickly and squeeze tightly through the point of contact
Dialogue: 69,0:20:16.00,0:20:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to impart a large amount of topspin onto the ball.
Dialogue: 69,0:20:18.49,0:20:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The topspin has her opponent on the back foot, that's why—
Dialogue: 69,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew that!
Dialogue: 69,0:20:28.38,0:20:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's topspin?
Dialogue: 69,0:20:29.60,0:20:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Y'know, when you spin the ball to the top.
Dialogue: 69,0:20:46.52,0:20:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sandbagging?
Dialogue: 69,0:20:48.80,0:20:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Play for real. Or is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 69,0:20:56.15,0:20:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,0:21:04.48,0:21:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck was that! It was so fast!
Dialogue: 69,0:21:05.68,0:21:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she serious now?
Dialogue: 69,0:21:14.68,0:21:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Wang Lu weak on the backhand?
Dialogue: 69,0:21:19.36,0:21:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She figured me out already?
Dialogue: 69,0:21:26.36,0:21:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,0:21:33.30,0:21:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 69,0:21:39.55,0:21:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she caught up!
Dialogue: 69,0:21:41.05,0:21:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just lucky! Lu can bring it back!
Dialogue: 69,0:21:42.96,0:21:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lu's got this!
Dialogue: 69,0:21:44.88,0:21:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But Zhang Rouzhi's something else.
Dialogue: 69,0:21:48.14,0:21:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Wang Lu's caught on to her own weakness,
Dialogue: 69,0:21:50.59,0:21:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,she can't fix it on the fly.
Dialogue: 69,0:22:09.48,0:22:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She might have this in the bag.{yea 1-5 to 8-5 time to go home lol}
Dialogue: 69,0:22:11.43,0:22:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is clearly just for fun, why's Zhang Rouzhi going all out?
Dialogue: 69,0:22:34.27,0:22:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,0:22:35.09,0:22:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely the ball's been rigged!
Dialogue: 69,0:22:43.44,0:22:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 69,0:22:47.49,0:22:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 4pm, we should call it for today.
Dialogue: 69,0:22:53.49,0:22:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over.
Dialogue: 69,0:23:54.91,0:23:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The light...
Dialogue: 69,0:24:13.38,0:24:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 69,0:24:15.93,0:24:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu's the best!
Dialogue: 69,0:24:16.48,0:24:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}She can totally bring it back!
Dialogue: 69,0:24:22.52,0:24:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Wang Lu! Show us how good you really are!
Dialogue: 69,0:24:40.08,0:24:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu, have you sorted out the documents?
Dialogue: 69,0:24:42.72,0:24:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have them here.
Dialogue: 69,0:24:44.29,0:24:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Hurry on home, then.
Dialogue: 69,0:24:46.51,0:24:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember to turn off the lights.
Dialogue: 69,0:24:47.61,0:24:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sir.
Dialogue: 69,0:24:57.73,0:24:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a scintillating match.
Dialogue: 69,0:24:59.57,0:25:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Pros really are built different.
Dialogue: 69,0:25:04.71,0:25:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu! You're joining the club, right?
Dialogue: 69,0:25:09.65,0:25:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not a competitive sports school.
Dialogue: 69,0:25:11.80,0:25:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't win anything even if I did join.
Dialogue: 69,0:25:14.37,0:25:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not true!
Dialogue: 69,0:25:15.40,0:25:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine with you and Zhang Rouzhi.
Dialogue: 69,0:25:30.92,0:25:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your match was like a martial arts exhibition!
Dialogue: 69,0:25:39.60,0:25:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu's loop was amazing, but you were even more amazing!
Dialogue: 69,0:25:44.01,0:25:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I got to see a game like that!
Dialogue: 69,0:25:47.67,0:25:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 69,0:25:49.15,0:25:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't played for a really long time.
Dialogue: 69,0:25:52.75,0:25:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 69,0:25:55.51,0:25:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know a great bubble tea place.
Dialogue: 69,0:25:58.60,0:25:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on me.
Dialogue: 69,0:26:01.50,0:26:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 69,0:26:11.78,0:26:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really surprised though.
Dialogue: 69,0:26:15.22,0:26:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only my first day but I've already met a ping pong pro.
Dialogue: 69,0:26:22.23,0:26:24.69,signs - watch,,0,0,0,,Mango Coconut\N Medium Size\N Regular Ice \NMAX SUGAR \NCoconut Jelly, Pearls
Dialogue: 69,0:26:26.18,0:26:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could help me get better at ping pong?
Dialogue: 69,0:26:31.68,0:26:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nowhere near good enough to teach—
Dialogue: 69,0:26:38.49,0:26:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Owies!
Dialogue: 69,0:26:42.36,0:26:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 69,0:26:55.10,0:26:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 69,0:26:56.82,0:26:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,To school?
Dialogue: 69,0:26:57.89,0:26:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,To table tennis practice.
Dialogue: 69,0:27:00.28,0:27:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now departing. Please hold on to the handrail.
Dialogue: 69,0:27:05.66,0:27:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bus is here.
Dialogue: 69,0:27:10.28,0:27:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 69,0:27:15.36,0:27:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now departing. Please hold on to the handrail.
Dialogue: 69,0:27:18.86,0:27:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next stop is...
Dialogue: 69,0:27:30.04,0:27:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you like ping pong?
Dialogue: 69,0:27:41.98,0:27:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A new chapter starts for all of us at Qiming High.
Dialogue: 69,0:27:48.28,0:27:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of us may have left our families, but you are not alone.
Dialogue: 69,0:27:52.21,0:27:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to fear the unknowns ahead,
Dialogue: 69,0:27:56.51,0:28:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,because our wonderful teachers and upperclassmen will shine a light,
Dialogue: 69,0:28:04.12,0:28:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and lead us to a brighter future.
Dialogue: 69,0:28:22.15,0:28:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't the ball look like a flash of lightning?
Dialogue: 69,0:28:45.09,0:28:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!
Dialogue: 69,0:28:57.17,0:29:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Our seniors are lighting the way for us.
Dialogue: 69,0:29:01.25,0:29:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our job to follow that light.
Dialogue: 69,0:29:05.20,0:29:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We should all have faith in what the future holds in store for us,
Dialogue: 69,0:29:08.56,0:29:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and make the most of this valuable period of our lives.
Dialogue: 69,0:29:11.19,0:29:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu the Prodigy vs Mysterious Pro: Zhang Ruozhi?
Dialogue: 69,0:29:16.05,0:29:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're recruiting.
Dialogue: 69,0:29:19.68,0:29:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks fun.
Dialogue: 69,0:29:23.74,0:29:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Which class are you from?
Dialogue: 69,0:29:27.36,0:29:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 69,0:29:29.50,0:29:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You have some nerve trying to sneak out!
Dialogue: 69,0:29:31.15,0:29:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's your homeroom teacher?
Dialogue: 69,0:29:41.78,0:29:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Xiao!
Dialogue: 69,0:29:43.43,0:29:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mr. Li!
Dialogue: 69,0:29:46.96,0:30:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[SPEAKING FOREIGNLY]
Dialogue: 69,0:30:03.30,0:30:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dammit.
Dialogue: 69,0:30:12.62,0:30:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, fuck!
Dialogue: 69,0:30:16.74,0:30:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your manners, Ding Xiao.
Dialogue: 69,0:30:19.38,0:30:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you at the staff room at lunch time.
Dialogue: 69,0:30:23.50,0:30:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1} I rewrote this speech 8 times, and you managed to ruin everything!
Dialogue: 69,0:30:28.11,0:30:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1} How many times are you gonna do this to me?
Dialogue: 69,0:30:30.01,0:30:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's get back to it.
Dialogue: 69,0:30:32.08,0:30:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Flip to page 5.
Dialogue: 69,0:30:38.12,0:30:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so I heard.
Dialogue: 69,0:30:39.01,0:30:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 69,0:30:40.33,0:30:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,0:30:41.86,0:30:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 69,0:30:43.78,0:30:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 69,0:30:51.27,0:30:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 69,0:30:53.49,0:30:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're mates.
Dialogue: 69,0:31:00.04,0:31:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it myself. Try some.
Dialogue: 69,0:31:02.08,0:31:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it sweet?
Dialogue: 69,0:31:03.78,0:31:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a little.
Dialogue: 69,0:31:05.84,0:31:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bite, then.
Dialogue: 69,0:31:20.56,0:31:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 69,0:31:21.37,0:31:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like sex in my mouth.{#2406}{m8}
Dialogue: 69,0:31:28.27,0:31:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you gonna join the ping pong club?
Dialogue: 69,0:31:30.91,0:31:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 69,0:31:32.33,0:31:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm planning to submit my application after this.
Dialogue: 69,0:31:37.26,0:31:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! We'll get to play pong together!
Dialogue: 69,0:31:39.91,0:31:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wew, lucky me!
Dialogue: 69,0:31:43.15,0:31:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If it ain't Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,0:31:45.63,0:31:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your poster on the bulletin board.
Dialogue: 69,0:31:48.28,0:31:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy that you're good at ping pong too.
Dialogue: 69,0:31:52.28,0:31:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play some time.
Dialogue: 69,0:31:55.30,0:31:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't Mr. Li tell you to go to the staff room?
Dialogue: 69,0:31:58.36,0:32:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't remind me. You're such a buzzkill.
Dialogue: 69,0:32:02.87,0:32:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway who's Zhang Ruozhi?
Dialogue: 69,0:32:03.40,0:32:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah, I love it.
Dialogue: 69,0:32:06.48,0:32:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've seen her before.
Dialogue: 69,0:32:07.51,0:32:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'd be happy for you to take mine.
Dialogue: 69,0:32:12.18,0:32:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently she's from Dongbei.
Dialogue: 69,0:32:16.00,0:32:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dongbei, huh?
Dialogue: 69,0:32:23.67,0:32:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just received word about the \NAsian Table Tennis Championship.
Dialogue: 69,0:32:27.18,0:32:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The women's singles group stage just ended.
Dialogue: 69,0:32:30.73,0:32:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruotong put on an amazing display of skill,
Dialogue: 69,0:32:33.70,0:32:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,overwhelming her opponent 3-0.
Dialogue: 69,0:32:36.35,0:32:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruotong, how are you enjoying being overseas for the tournament?
Dialogue: 69,0:32:41.04,0:32:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not bad. There are lots of people here!
Dialogue: 69,0:32:44.34,0:32:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, check this out! I lined up for an hour and a half to buy this for my sister.
Dialogue: 69,0:32:49.18,0:32:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you watching, Ruozhi?
Dialogue: 69,0:32:52.96,0:32:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That name sounds familiar.
Dialogue: 69,0:32:56.10,0:32:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's you! Zhang Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,0:33:00.18,0:33:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi?
Dialogue: 69,0:33:05.76,0:33:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 69,0:33:07.33,0:33:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Zhang Ruotong's sister?
Dialogue: 69,0:33:11.10,0:33:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,From the national team?
Dialogue: 69,0:33:15.04,0:33:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 69,0:33:20.01,0:33:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The{\i0} National Team?
Dialogue: 69,0:33:21.96,0:33:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a surprise.
Dialogue: 69,0:33:23.90,0:33:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder she's so good.
Dialogue: 69,0:33:25.50,0:33:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Think she was hiding her power level?
Dialogue: 69,0:33:29.34,0:33:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the ruckus?
Dialogue: 69,0:33:30.82,0:33:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Xiao, didn't I tell you to come to the staff room?
Dialogue: 69,0:33:34.51,0:33:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My b', Teach! I'll head over now!
Dialogue: 69,0:33:36.62,0:33:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoopsie!
Dialogue: 69,0:33:37.80,0:33:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Slipped me mind with all the big news.
Dialogue: 69,0:33:40.51,0:33:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Smell ya later, lil sis!
Dialogue: 69,0:33:45.71,0:33:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wew, lad.
Dialogue: 69,0:34:01.65,0:34:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, is this Zhang Ruotong's autograph?
Dialogue: 69,0:34:05.47,0:34:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 69,0:34:06.31,0:34:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi!\N Is it true your sister can use either hand?
Dialogue: 69,0:34:10.07,0:34:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 69,0:34:12.21,0:34:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, no.
Dialogue: 69,0:34:13.88,0:34:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,0:34:15.45,0:34:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me that secret move of yours!
Dialogue: 69,0:34:20.39,0:34:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The ball that zings like a lightning bolt!
Dialogue: 69,0:34:23.87,0:34:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The banana flick that rends the Heavens!
Dialogue: 69,0:34:26.29,0:34:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The miraculous smash that puts Calderano to shame!
Dialogue: 69,0:34:29.38,0:34:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Haiya!
Dialogue: 69,0:34:33.08,0:34:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta take a slash.
Dialogue: 69,0:34:40.40,0:34:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like everyone has high hopes for the national player's darling sister.
Dialogue: 69,0:34:46.59,0:34:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you joining the club?
Dialogue: 69,0:34:49.46,0:34:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm far too busy for that.
Dialogue: 69,0:34:53.46,0:34:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. That's a shame.
Dialogue: 69,0:34:58.60,0:35:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shot yesterday was great.
Dialogue: 69,0:35:10.50,0:35:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one shot?
Dialogue: 69,0:35:11.87,0:35:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's how good our school is.
Dialogue: 69,0:35:15.60,0:35:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get your hopes up.
Dialogue: 69,0:35:24.88,0:35:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think everyone would be so interested in you,
Dialogue: 69,0:35:27.88,0:35:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but I guess it's pretty exciting by our school's standards.
Dialogue: 69,0:35:31.15,0:35:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get to you. Let's take it easy.
Dialogue: 69,0:35:34.37,0:35:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 69,0:35:36.16,0:35:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get used to it in no time.
Dialogue: 69,0:35:41.82,0:35:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, little sister.
Dialogue: 69,0:35:45.57,0:35:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you joining?
Dialogue: 69,0:35:46.48,0:35:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 69,0:35:48.08,0:35:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I redid mine too, Captain.
Dialogue: 69,0:35:49.81,0:35:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm joining too!
Dialogue: 69,0:35:51.29,0:35:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is mine! Don't reject me!
Dialogue: 69,0:35:54.59,0:35:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Xiao! You're joining too?
Dialogue: 69,0:35:56.96,0:35:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You know her?
Dialogue: 69,0:35:57.74,0:35:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're classmates!
Dialogue: 69,0:35:59.30,0:36:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach! I wanna play ping pong!
Dialogue: 69,0:36:10.17,0:36:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. I got a bit carried away.
Dialogue: 69,0:36:18.10,0:36:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach?!
Dialogue: 69,0:36:19.40,0:36:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach?!
Dialogue: 69,0:36:27.76,0:36:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this everyone?
Dialogue: 69,0:36:35.44,0:36:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Liu Chang.
Dialogue: 69,0:36:37.87,0:36:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me Coach Liu.
Dialogue: 69,0:36:40.42,0:36:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We used to just be a recreational club, but as of this year we're an official team.
Dialogue: 69,0:36:45.72,0:36:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you've already played a match yesterday.
Dialogue: 69,0:36:48.94,0:36:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was great PR. Look how many hopefuls we have.
Dialogue: 69,0:36:53.58,0:36:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful. Welcome to the team.
Dialogue: 69,0:36:56.85,0:36:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 69,0:36:58.72,0:37:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to determine skill levels.
Dialogue: 69,0:37:02.16,0:37:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah! Let's get down to ponging!
Dialogue: 69,0:37:05.17,0:37:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head down to the first floor later for a few tests.
Dialogue: 69,0:37:08.67,0:37:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Xiao, you're a penholder?
Dialogue: 69,0:37:11.14,0:37:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not too many penholders these days!
Dialogue: 69,0:37:13.33,0:37:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I see your rubber?{lood}
Dialogue: 69,0:37:15.54,0:37:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 69,0:37:16.34,0:37:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's a DHS Hurricane 3 National Blue Sponge™!
Dialogue: 69,0:37:19.90,0:37:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got an extremely tacky topsheet so it's super spinny.
Dialogue: 69,0:37:22.77,0:37:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Great for looping backspin, and has an excellent short game too.{whoa lore accuracy?}
Dialogue: 69,0:37:26.39,0:37:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no slouch for close-to-the-table attacks and still has powerful drives at mid-distance.
Dialogue: 69,0:37:29.95,0:37:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 69,0:37:30.83,0:37:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya sure love to yap, don'tcha!
Dialogue: 69,0:37:34.74,0:37:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi, wanna ping some pong?
Dialogue: 69,0:37:36.98,0:37:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You already played Wang Lu, give me a game too!
Dialogue: 69,0:37:40.78,0:37:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After the tests, okay?
Dialogue: 69,0:37:45.31,0:37:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be anxious.
Dialogue: 69,0:37:46.78,0:37:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We call them tests, but I just want to see where everyone's at.
Dialogue: 69,0:37:51.62,0:37:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There are six in all.
Dialogue: 69,0:37:54.18,0:37:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forward when your name is called.
Dialogue: 69,0:38:06.06,0:38:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, Ding Xiao.
Dialogue: 69,0:38:23.70,0:38:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Xintong, you need to train your core.
Dialogue: 69,0:38:32.30,0:38:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,2 metres.
Dialogue: 69,0:38:33.35,0:38:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 69,0:38:37.04,0:38:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,1.4.
Dialogue: 69,0:38:37.89,0:38:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu was right. They're all beginners.
Dialogue: 69,0:38:40.77,0:38:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not particularly athletic, either.
Dialogue: 69,0:38:55.02,0:38:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Xiao! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 69,0:38:56.38,0:38:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame, the jump itself was great.
Dialogue: 69,0:38:58.60,0:39:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try again!
Dialogue: 69,0:39:01.17,0:39:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That was an amazing jump! Is there a trick to it?
Dialogue: 69,0:39:04.27,0:39:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandma always told me to stuff myself with chicken thighs!
Dialogue: 69,0:39:11.79,0:39:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's more or less how it went.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:13.22,0:39:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, thanks.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:14.78,0:39:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:17.19,0:39:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss He?
Dialogue: 69,0:39:18.53,0:39:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Ding Xiao's, from your class.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:21.19,0:39:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure she gets it.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:24.01,0:39:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Xiao was yelling about joining the ping pong club.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:27.54,0:39:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be in the gym.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:34.18,0:39:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the final trial.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:36.62,0:39:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see your receives.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:38.64,0:39:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want you to return the balls that the machine spits out.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:42.76,0:39:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be watching your fundamentals.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:45.60,0:39:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the model from two years ago.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:47.27,0:39:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Comes in at a pretty good price but its rhythm isn't anything spectacular.
Dialogue: 69,0:39:49.91,0:39:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We should buy the newest model!
Dialogue: 69,0:39:52.20,0:39:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can really fine-tune the placement, spin, and speed,
Dialogue: 69,0:39:55.52,0:39:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and set up training menus super easily!
Dialogue: 69,0:39:56.92,0:39:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll feel just like a real match!
Dialogue: 69,0:39:59.64,0:40:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have any money.
Dialogue: 69,0:40:01.49,0:40:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The latest one is way out of budget.
Dialogue: 69,0:40:04.69,0:40:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi, you're first up. Show us how it's done.
Dialogue: 69,0:40:08.50,0:40:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 69,0:40:25.02,0:40:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, she must've trained really hard.
Dialogue: 69,0:40:27.25,0:40:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Her foundation is great.
Dialogue: 69,0:40:29.10,0:40:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone good with that?
Dialogue: 69,0:40:31.71,0:40:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come up when your name is called.
Dialogue: 69,0:40:45.73,0:40:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no fun playing a clanker.
Dialogue: 69,0:40:59.60,0:41:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, lil sis!
Dialogue: 69,0:41:01.55,0:41:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is lame, let's go!
Dialogue: 69,0:41:03.48,0:41:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you know you want to.
Dialogue: 69,0:41:06.89,0:41:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 69,0:41:10.41,0:41:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, watch out!
Dialogue: 69,0:41:12.40,0:41:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this.
Dialogue: 69,0:41:21.45,0:41:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, Ding Xiao!
Dialogue: 69,0:41:22.77,0:41:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you pick that up?
Dialogue: 69,0:41:24.52,0:41:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach me!
Dialogue: 69,0:41:25.01,0:41:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That ain't nothin'—
Dialogue: 69,0:41:28.99,0:41:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sup?
Dialogue: 69,0:41:31.20,0:41:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of a test.
Dialogue: 69,0:41:34.55,0:41:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're just here to mess around then get out.
Dialogue: 69,0:41:42.47,0:41:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play with someone's balls.\N Let's chill out a bit?
Dialogue: 69,0:41:46.14,0:41:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right. My b'!
Dialogue: 69,0:41:49.16,0:41:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 69,0:41:52.43,0:41:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder what's gotten into her.
Dialogue: 69,0:42:01.43,0:42:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Clock's ticking.
Dialogue: 69,0:42:03.11,0:42:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 69,0:42:05.92,0:42:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You think it's okay to be lax just because it's a test?
Dialogue: 69,0:42:33.95,0:42:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Practising?
Dialogue: 69,0:42:35.39,0:42:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 69,0:42:38.45,0:42:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Looking to join the club?
Dialogue: 69,0:42:40.82,0:42:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately not.
Dialogue: 69,0:42:42.10,0:42:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came to deliver Ding Xiao's notebook.
Dialogue: 69,0:42:44.13,0:42:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 69,0:42:45.23,0:42:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks! I was looking everywhere for this!
Dialogue: 69,0:42:48.17,0:42:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy for you.
Dialogue: 69,0:43:11.83,0:43:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't she loosen up a little?
Dialogue: 69,0:43:15.67,0:43:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 69,0:43:17.75,0:43:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They've already elected representatives our age.
Dialogue: 69,0:43:20.41,0:43:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't make it next time then we'll just have to quit.
Dialogue: 69,0:43:33.66,0:43:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your coaching.
Dialogue: 69,0:43:36.37,0:43:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be a bad idea for her to dedicate herself to her studies,
Dialogue: 69,0:43:40.42,0:43:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,as much as it pains me to suggest.
Dialogue: 69,0:43:52.71,0:43:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I could teach you how to study,
Dialogue: 69,0:43:57.80,0:44:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the same way you taught me table tennis.
Dialogue: 69,0:44:06.36,0:44:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 69,0:44:15.47,0:44:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Announcement to all passengers boarding flight HO1257 to Hangzhou.
Dialogue: 69,0:44:21.49,0:44:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're currently allowing passengers onboard the aircraft.
Dialogue: 69,0:44:27.09,0:44:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you study hard once you get to Hangzhou.
Dialogue: 69,0:44:31.56,0:44:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your racket case is pretty worn out, right?
Dialogue: 69,0:44:33.66,0:44:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I got you a new one.
Dialogue: 69,0:44:46.60,0:44:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruozhi.
Dialogue: 69,0:44:48.26,0:44:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you. I thought you got lost again.
Dialogue: 69,0:44:51.91,0:44:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The tests are done. Let's go home.
Dialogue: 69,0:44:54.21,0:44:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about before. I lost my composure.
Dialogue: 69,0:44:57.40,0:44:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Ding Xiao?
Dialogue: 69,0:44:59.11,0:45:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 69,0:45:00.79,0:45:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She flew out the doors as soon as the test finished.
Dialogue: 69,0:45:03.26,0:45:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With a big smile.
Dialogue: 69,0:45:06.07,0:45:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 69,0:45:21.64,0:45:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi is in her own tier,
Dialogue: 69,0:45:23.88,0:45:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and Ding Xiao is full of unrefined raw talent.
Dialogue: 69,0:45:29.33,0:45:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Talent isn't everything.
Dialogue: 69,0:45:31.30,0:45:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a single good player without talent.
Dialogue: 69,0:45:35.48,0:45:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 69,0:45:41.15,0:45:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope those two get along.
Dialogue: 69,0:45:47.81,0:45:51.81,signs - watch,,0,0,0,,{Sign}Yusheng
Dialogue: 69,0:45:47.81,0:45:51.81,signs - watch,,0,0,0,,{Sign}Zhang Ruotong's little sister is over there?
Dialogue: 69,0:45:49.60,0:45:51.81,signs - watch,,0,0,0,,{Sign}Interesting.
Dialogue: 69,0:46:07.98,0:46:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 69,0:46:09.29,0:46:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"Steel is tempered by fire."
Dialogue: 69,0:46:18.96,0:46:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the pressure get to you, Ruozhi.
Dialogue: 69,0:46:22.77,0:46:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we only just started.
Dialogue: 69,0:46:25.96,0:46:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 69,0:46:27.24,0:46:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The team only just formed, but we have you and Ding Xiao!
Dialogue: 69,0:46:31.48,0:46:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's going to get way better!
Dialogue: 69,0:46:36.04,0:46:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you missed!
Dialogue: 69,0:46:40.58,0:46:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, you missed again!
Dialogue: 69,0:46:42.59,0:46:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 69,0:46:43.24,0:46:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dang, can you believe it?
Dialogue: 69,0:46:46.37,0:46:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, you lost!
Dialogue: 69,0:46:46.37,0:46:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we said 3 tries! I still have one more!
Dialogue: 69,0:46:51.05,0:46:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, yay, yay!
Dialogue: 69,0:46:52.87,0:46:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm winning this, watch out!
Dialogue: 69,0:47:02.01,0:47:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You missed again!
Dialogue: 69,0:47:05.02,0:47:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 69,0:47:06.91,0:47:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You better keep your end of the deal!
Dialogue: 69,0:47:09.71,0:47:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fine. One pack each, all right?
Dialogue: 69,0:47:13.03,0:47:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the table tennis team now, so I'm not about to get competitive over nothing.
Dialogue: 69,0:47:37.96,0:47:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Xiao can really get along with anyone, can't she?
Dialogue: 69,0:47:42.34,0:47:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to play around like that when I was younger.
Dialogue: 69,0:47:46.42,0:47:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then I couldn't even really get the ball back over.
Dialogue: 69,0:47:50.24,0:47:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ping pong balls are so small, but you can spin them this way and that.
Dialogue: 69,0:47:55.69,0:47:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They're full of unlimited potential.
Dialogue: 69,0:48:08.34,0:48:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlimited potential?
Dialogue: 69,0:48:12.65,0:48:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, a gay ping pong cartoon?
Dialogue: 69,0:48:14.82,0:48:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing.
Dialogue: 69,0:48:17.03,0:48:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Xiao!
Dialogue: 69,0:48:18.20,0:48:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bad manners to eavesdrop!
Dialogue: 69,0:48:22.31,0:48:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you eavesdropping on me first?
Dialogue: 69,0:48:29.09,0:48:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry for getting mad at you during practice.
Dialogue: 69,0:48:38.12,0:48:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, we're teammates!
Dialogue: 69,0:48:40.44,0:48:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it happen again, yeah?
Dialogue: 69,0:48:41.90,0:48:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop imitating me!
Dialogue: 69,0:48:43.60,0:48:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's a compliment!
Dialogue: 69,0:48:45.24,0:48:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 69,0:48:50.85,0:48:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I got you a present. How's school?
Dialogue: 69,0:48:53.68,0:48:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let me know what you've been up to.
Dialogue: 69,0:48:56.71,0:48:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't forget to have fun playing ping pong.
Dialogue: 69,0:48:59.04,0:48:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Love you!
Dialogue: 69,0:48:59.71,0:49:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so annoying! Stay still!
Dialogue: 69,0:49:02.05,0:49:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch me if you can!
Dialogue: 69,0:49:02.76,0:49:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop running!
Dialogue: 69,0:49:12.64,0:49:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been an accident involving three vehicles, which has—
Dialogue: 69,0:49:21.79,0:49:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Coach?
Dialogue: 69,0:49:23.63,0:49:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any friends at Qiming High?
Dialogue: 69,0:49:27.29,0:49:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure do! A friend back from pre-school!
Dialogue: 69,0:49:35.84,0:49:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Old mate Luzza.
Dialogue: 69,0:49:47.88,0:49:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you interested in table tennis lessons?
Dialogue: 69,0:49:51.01,0:49:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We keep our classes small, and do 1:1 training too!
Dialogue: 69,0:49:54.84,0:49:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sign up now for 30% off!
Dialogue: 69,0:49:56.47,0:49:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The coach is a former provincial level player!
Dialogue: 69,0:50:07.27,0:50:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You can start off with a free trial!
Dialogue: 69,0:50:09.95,0:50:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in the table tennis club, so that won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 69,0:50:13.92,0:50:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 69,0:50:18.04,0:50:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 69,0:50:21.83,0:50:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up! Would you like to come?
Dialogue: 69,0:50:24.96,0:50:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Our coach is really good!
Dialogue: 69,0:50:33.55,0:50:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you look over your mistakes.
Dialogue: 69,0:50:35.72,0:50:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go over the answers next time.
Dialogue: 69,0:50:40.11,0:50:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That quiz was rough.
Dialogue: 69,0:50:42.10,0:50:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I flunked hard.
Dialogue: 69,0:50:42.10,0:50:43.31,signs - watch,,0,0,0,,{sign}Fly like Xuperman.
Dialogue: 69,0:50:44.55,0:50:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to practice!
Dialogue: 69,0:50:51.78,0:50:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 69,0:50:54.87,0:50:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you could look at my forehand?
Dialogue: 69,0:50:57.16,0:50:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 69,0:51:00.40,0:51:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think our pong team can win anything?
Dialogue: 69,0:51:03.65,0:51:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She's their only good player.
Dialogue: 69,0:51:05.81,0:51:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lu's given up on them long ago.
Dialogue: 69,0:51:08.00,0:51:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No shot.
Dialogue: 69,0:51:10.96,0:51:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going.
Dialogue: 69,0:51:12.88,0:51:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my biology elective.
Dialogue: 69,0:51:29.89,0:51:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi has great fundamentals and her defence is solid,{torn fix}
Dialogue: 69,0:51:34.32,0:51:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but she doesn't really go on the offensive.
Dialogue: 69,0:51:37.04,0:51:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost looks like she lacks confidence.
Dialogue: 69,0:51:39.68,0:51:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's quite preoccupied with being compared to her sister.
Dialogue: 69,0:51:43.62,0:51:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Xiao has a very unorthodox playstyle,
Dialogue: 69,0:51:47.13,0:51:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but she's fickle and inconsistent.
Dialogue: 69,0:51:51.22,0:51:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the others...
Dialogue: 69,0:51:58.38,0:51:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 69,0:51:58.64,0:52:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The armchair expert is quite consistent.
Dialogue: 69,0:52:04.02,0:52:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be a tough one.
Dialogue: 69,0:52:05.41,0:52:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 69,0:52:08.15,0:52:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised Lin High that we'd play an interleague together,
Dialogue: 69,0:52:11.11,0:52:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't think we can win at our current level.
Dialogue: 69,0:52:15.71,0:52:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 69,0:52:19.12,0:52:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, Coach!
Dialogue: 69,0:52:21.14,0:52:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can play against Lin High!
Dialogue: 69,0:52:24.10,0:52:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 69,0:52:25.87,0:52:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I not mention it?
Dialogue: 69,0:52:28.44,0:52:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first I've heard of it!
Dialogue: 69,0:52:30.29,0:52:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he talking about Linjiang Experimental High School?
Dialogue: 69,0:52:32.63,0:52:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,?{lol}
Dialogue: 69,0:52:34.88,0:52:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know Lin High?
Dialogue: 69,0:52:39.42,0:52:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a famous powerhouse school, always first place in the district.
Dialogue: 69,0:52:43.96,0:52:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention top three in the city.
Dialogue: 69,0:52:45.78,0:52:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Their training is super hardcore.
Dialogue: 69,0:52:47.65,0:52:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got plenty of famous players from as early as middle school.
Dialogue: 69,0:52:51.69,0:52:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So why is this newly-formed club facing a school like that?
Dialogue: 69,0:52:55.74,0:52:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can always count on Li Xintong to know her stuff!
Dialogue: 69,0:52:57.68,0:52:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to change the topic.
Dialogue: 69,0:53:01.92,0:53:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got plenty of great players too.
Dialogue: 69,0:53:09.07,0:53:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But yeah, we still have plenty of gaps to fill as a team.
Dialogue: 69,0:53:13.70,0:53:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Would be great if 10 strong players fell into my lap right about now.
Dialogue: 69,0:53:18.01,0:53:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that would happen.
Dialogue: 69,0:53:20.08,0:53:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Even just one more...
Dialogue: 69,0:53:27.73,0:53:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, don't you think everyone might get a bit disheartened
Dialogue: 69,0:53:31.53,0:53:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,if we have to face such a strong school right off the bat?
Dialogue: 69,0:53:38.74,0:53:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone.
Dialogue: 69,0:53:40.84,0:53:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Our team may have just come together,
Dialogue: 69,0:53:42.57,0:53:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but that also means we have unlimited potential.
Dialogue: 69,0:53:46.29,0:53:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The match against Lin High is just the first step.
Dialogue: 69,0:53:49.57,0:53:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our real objective is...
Dialogue: 69,0:53:52.78,0:53:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory at the city team tournament!
Dialogue: 69,0:53:56.30,0:53:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 69,0:53:57.66,0:53:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Win? Us?
Dialogue: 69,0:53:59.30,0:54:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. We don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:02.77,0:54:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really that hard?
Dialogue: 69,0:54:04.64,0:54:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be right.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:05.53,0:54:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 69,0:54:08.80,0:54:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gonna be prize money, ain't there?
Dialogue: 69,0:54:11.61,0:54:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:12.46,0:54:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's serious?
Dialogue: 69,0:54:14.36,0:54:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The prize money... is pretty trivial.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:17.76,0:54:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe enough for all of us to get BBQ about 10 times.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:21.71,0:54:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Without using any coupons.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:22.97,0:54:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah! We're winning this!
Dialogue: 69,0:54:27.47,0:54:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We may as well restock the tea leaves in our training room too.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:31.61,0:54:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:33.25,0:54:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And we could buy the latest ping pong robot.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:37.40,0:54:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We really need to win, then!
Dialogue: 69,0:54:39.26,0:54:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I want meat in my mouth!
Dialogue: 69,0:54:39.26,0:54:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go research which robots have the best specs!
Dialogue: 69,0:54:45.45,0:54:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, knock yourselves out. Let's get back to practice!
Dialogue: 69,0:54:50.04,0:54:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough for today. Good work everyone.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:52.02,0:54:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 69,0:54:53.04,0:54:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Smell ya later, nerds!
Dialogue: 69,0:54:56.27,0:54:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 69,0:54:57.44,0:54:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 69,0:55:01.56,0:55:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Xintong, can I borrow you tomorrow?
Dialogue: 69,0:55:04.54,0:55:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, what do you need?
Dialogue: 69,0:55:08.86,0:55:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We have budget to get our uniforms. Would you like to come shopping?
Dialogue: 69,0:55:12.16,0:55:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you can find us something nice.
Dialogue: 69,0:55:14.00,0:55:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd love to!
Dialogue: 69,0:55:17.36,0:55:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,See you at 2pm, then.
Dialogue: 69,0:55:18.38,0:55:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 69,0:55:18.96,0:55:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Longxiangqiao Station, exit C.
Dialogue: 69,0:55:21.71,0:55:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need to make sure they have cute designs and good ventilation.
Dialogue: 69,0:55:24.57,0:55:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Shorts or culottes? Both could be good.
Dialogue: 69,0:55:26.57,0:55:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And—
Dialogue: 69,0:55:27.47,0:55:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ruozhi! If you have time, would you like to come?
Dialogue: 69,0:55:32.27,0:55:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruozhi?
Dialogue: 69,0:55:34.96,0:55:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 69,0:55:36.90,0:55:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 69,0:55:39.17,0:55:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have enough strong players, right?
Dialogue: 69,0:55:41.80,0:55:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking.
Dialogue: 69,0:55:45.44,0:55:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to invite her?
Dialogue: 69,0:56:06.76,0:56:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all for the trial lesson.
Dialogue: 69,0:56:09.30,0:56:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a few quirks, but you're quite strong.
Dialogue: 69,0:56:13.08,0:56:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to continue your lessons and work on improving?
Dialogue: 69,0:56:16.08,0:56:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Having some results under your belt will help when applying for university.
Dialogue: 69,0:56:21.49,0:56:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I'm pretty good at school.
Dialogue: 69,0:56:26.95,0:56:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you are?
Dialogue: 69,0:56:28.40,0:56:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well you don't need to take it seriously. Ping pong's a great hobby too.
Dialogue: 69,0:56:31.86,0:56:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll leave you to it.
Dialogue: 69,0:56:41.01,0:56:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hobby...
Dialogue: 69,0:56:49.94,0:56:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the culprit!
Dialogue: 69,0:56:52.47,0:56:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't repeat your crimes just because you refuse to take a good look in the mirror!{gross bed appler}
Dialogue: 69,0:57:33.12,0:57:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be a big waste of talent for you to give up on table tennis.
Dialogue: 69,0:57:37.44,0:57:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being genuine here.
Dialogue: 69,0:57:50.28,0:57:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They're aiming to win? The team just formed. Imbeciles.
Dialogue: 69,0:58:01.92,0:58:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You got time? Let me take you out for a date!{why's she chu2 ppg}
Dialogue: 69,0:58:07.55,0:58:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not studying in secret, are you?
Dialogue: 69,0:58:09.89,0:58:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely not, right?
Dialogue: 69,0:58:11.31,0:58:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you, miss honours student!
Dialogue: 69,0:58:23.75,0:58:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This blows.
Dialogue: 69,0:58:24.43,0:58:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 69,0:58:25.38,0:58:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 69,0:58:26.71,0:58:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're meeting up at Longxiangqiao Station exit C at 2pm.
Dialogue: 69,0:58:45.57,0:58:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu? I thought she wasn't ponging.
Dialogue: 69,0:59:17.56,0:59:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, forget it.
Dialogue: 69,0:59:23.67,0:59:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Zh-Zh-Zhang Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,0:59:25.42,0:59:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a member here?
Dialogue: 69,0:59:30.35,0:59:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it to you? S-S-Stalker!
Dialogue: 69,0:59:32.84,0:59:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not. Why not join the team if you want to pong?
Dialogue: 69,0:59:40.31,0:59:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I want.
Dialogue: 69,0:59:44.94,0:59:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's puff diddy!
Dialogue: 69,0:59:49.37,0:59:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,G'day Luzza!
Dialogue: 69,0:59:53.31,0:59:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mate?
Dialogue: 69,0:59:54.66,0:59:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going home. I have stuff to do.
Dialogue: 69,1:00:01.78,1:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanganasec, Luzza!
Dialogue: 69,1:00:06.08,1:00:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I got on me bike just to see ya!
Dialogue: 69,1:00:08.30,1:00:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Struth ya can't've forgotten me!
Dialogue: 69,1:00:11.03,1:00:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 69,1:00:13.34,1:00:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ya best mate, Long Shao!
Dialogue: 69,1:00:15.36,1:00:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Was our friendship from kindy worth two-fifths of fuck-all?
Dialogue: 69,1:00:19.73,1:00:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crack the shits!
Dialogue: 69,1:00:23.18,1:00:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the fuck up!
Dialogue: 69,1:00:28.74,1:00:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 69,1:00:30.49,1:00:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, you remembered me?
Dialogue: 69,1:00:32.05,1:00:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe you're going to pong class instead of the Hub.
Dialogue: 69,1:00:35.55,1:00:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tryin' ya damndest just like the ol' days!
Dialogue: 69,1:00:40.32,1:00:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shit.
Dialogue: 69,1:00:48.52,1:00:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruozhi might be lost again.
Dialogue: 69,1:00:57.89,1:01:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you're famous around these parts, Ding Xiao?
Dialogue: 69,1:01:01.41,1:01:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I ain't nobody.
Dialogue: 69,1:01:04.66,1:01:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao and Granny Wang, and Grandpa Liu are incredible.
Dialogue: 69,1:01:14.16,1:01:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Wang Lu?
Dialogue: 69,1:01:20.26,1:01:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Smells like something fun is about to happen.
Dialogue: 69,1:01:26.54,1:01:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that girl is from Lin Tech's table tennis team.
Dialogue: 69,1:01:30.33,1:01:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, surprised you know that.
Dialogue: 69,1:01:32.96,1:01:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Xintong told me. She took notes for our match.
Dialogue: 69,1:01:37.42,1:01:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing with Wang Lu?
Dialogue: 69,1:01:45.05,1:01:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here she is, Nazza!
Dialogue: 69,1:01:47.67,1:01:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 69,1:01:48.48,1:01:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Chen Ningning from Linjiang Experimental High.
Dialogue: 69,1:01:52.45,1:01:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu.
Dialogue: 69,1:01:54.32,1:01:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 69,1:01:55.31,1:01:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Zhang Ruozhi?
Dialogue: 69,1:01:57.42,1:01:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who tha 'ell is Zhang Ruozhi?
Dialogue: 69,1:02:02.66,1:02:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach told me that there's an incredible player at Qiming.
Dialogue: 69,1:02:06.48,1:02:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend, Wang Lu—
Dialogue: 69,1:02:09.17,1:02:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bloody oath. This be Luzza.
Dialogue: 69,1:02:11.61,1:02:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,—lost to her. You jumped the gun a bit.
Dialogue: 69,1:02:17.27,1:02:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She's Zhang Ruotong's little sister.
Dialogue: 69,1:02:20.67,1:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in for a rough time if you underestimate her. Later.
Dialogue: 69,1:02:24.38,1:02:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who died and made you the king?
Dialogue: 69,1:02:26.89,1:02:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Zhang Ruozhi here!
Dialogue: 69,1:02:28.64,1:02:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 69,1:02:30.64,1:02:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't she your mate?
Dialogue: 69,1:02:33.65,1:02:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell the lass someone wants her to teach em pong.
Dialogue: 69,1:02:38.79,1:02:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you not on the team?
Dialogue: 69,1:02:42.40,1:02:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna play? Or too pissweak to join?
Dialogue: 69,1:02:45.37,1:02:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like at the selection tournament.
Dialogue: 69,1:02:49.06,1:02:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yea, Wang Lu! Why don't you join our team?
Dialogue: 69,1:02:54.45,1:02:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Xiao?
Dialogue: 69,1:03:02.64,1:03:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Crikey! Who the blazes are you?
Dialogue: 69,1:03:03.97,1:03:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it all on tape. You're all up in our business, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 69,1:03:07.88,1:03:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If ya wanna get to Zhang Ruozhi, then you gotta get through me first!
Dialogue: 69,1:03:11.73,1:03:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost, braids! Nobody asked you!
Dialogue: 69,1:03:14.37,1:03:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You really wanna play?
Dialogue: 69,1:03:18.48,1:03:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be doubles, though.
Dialogue: 69,1:03:22.10,1:03:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on.
Dialogue: 69,1:03:23.65,1:03:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Wang Lu, let's do this.
Dialogue: 69,1:03:34.67,1:03:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 69,1:03:36.09,1:03:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she made it!
Dialogue: 69,1:03:37.50,1:03:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I got caught up in a bunch of stuff on the way.
Dialogue: 69,1:03:46.05,1:03:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're they? They said they wanna see how good Zhang Ruozhi is.
Dialogue: 69,1:03:50.64,1:03:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Ding Xiao's gonna play against Lin High!
Dialogue: 69,1:03:54.03,1:03:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They said to call Zhang Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,1:03:56.88,1:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Wang Lu doing there?
Dialogue: 69,1:04:04.89,1:04:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Still can't make up your mind?
Dialogue: 69,1:04:08.32,1:04:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just join the junior league if ya don't have the balls.
Dialogue: 69,1:04:12.18,1:04:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This midget sure loves to yap!
Dialogue: 69,1:04:14.92,1:04:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it, braids!
Dialogue: 69,1:04:17.26,1:04:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,On the off chance you beat me, I'll give you my Centrelink!
Dialogue: 69,1:04:19.68,1:04:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? How do they even see you at the counter?
Dialogue: 69,1:04:23.54,1:04:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come at me, cunt!
Dialogue: 69,1:04:25.36,1:04:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 69,1:04:26.91,1:04:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Our business is with Zhang Ruozhi.
Dialogue: 69,1:04:28.75,1:04:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll visit your school some time. See you.{whoa sharing bats}
Dialogue: 69,1:04:32.78,1:04:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need me,
Dialogue: 69,1:04:35.83,1:04:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'm right here.
Dialogue: 69,1:04:37.36,1:04:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ruozhi! And the other two!{lmao}
Dialogue: 69,1:04:39.86,1:04:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,'Allo, cunts!
Dialogue: 69,1:04:40.86,1:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's her?
Dialogue: 69,1:04:42.74,1:04:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the sheila that was with Luzza!
Dialogue: 69,1:04:45.94,1:04:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the main character's arrived. It's all yours.
Dialogue: 69,1:04:49.45,1:04:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Luzza! At least stay to watch her lose!
Dialogue: 69,1:05:14.12,1:05:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruozhi, wait!
Dialogue: 69,1:05:16.37,1:05:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our team's secret weapon.
Dialogue: 69,1:05:18.16,1:05:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them see your play.
Dialogue: 69,1:05:19.64,1:05:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 69,1:05:22.20,1:05:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret weapon?
Dialogue: 69,1:05:25.10,1:05:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 69,1:05:27.94,1:05:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to accept their challenge.
Dialogue: 69,1:05:31.68,1:05:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 69,1:05:34.79,1:05:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see how good they are.
Dialogue: 69,1:05:38.32,1:05:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.{the threesome bat share??}
Dialogue: 69,1:05:43.27,1:05:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up? Shakin' in yer booties?
Dialogue: 69,1:05:45.89,1:05:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're here to spy then we have our conditions too.
Dialogue: 69,1:05:50.49,1:05:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at her go! Small but feisty!
Dialogue: 69,1:05:54.74,1:05:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's shaking now, shrimpo?
Dialogue: 69,1:06:00.57,1:06:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over quickly. Right?
Dialogue: 69,1:06:05.61,1:06:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go cryin' to mum!
Dialogue: 69,1:06:18.96,1:06:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 69,1:06:22.38,1:06:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not half bad!
Dialogue: 69,1:06:25.19,1:06:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 69,1:06:27.69,1:06:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting me fired up now.
Dialogue: 69,1:06:30.80,1:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that, shrimpo?
Dialogue: 69,1:06:33.63,1:06:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't be an easy sweep for you guys.
Dialogue: 69,1:06:49.76,1:06:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The light is green.
Dialogue: 69,1:06:53.86,1:06:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to win everything so easily.
Dialogue: 69,1:07:00.69,1:07:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I could just get on stage and draw everyone's attention.
Dialogue: 69,1:07:09.76,1:07:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But I knew the day I'd lose was just around the corner.
Dialogue: 69,1:07:23.91,1:07:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you quit,
Dialogue: 69,1:07:26.33,1:07:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,then you never lose.
Dialogue: 69,1:07:32.93,1:07:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just her grades—Wang Lu is also great at table tennis.
Dialogue: 69,1:07:36.32,1:07:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why doesn't she play any matches?
Dialogue: 69,1:07:39.25,1:07:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Table tennis is just a hobby. Don't let it get ahead of your studies.
Dialogue: 69,1:07:43.49,1:07:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on school and build up your foundations so that you can go on exchange.
Dialogue: 69,1:07:47.44,1:07:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to hear that, but I'll respect your decision.
Dialogue: 69,1:07:52.44,1:07:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to come back and play whenever you like.
Dialogue: 69,1:08:02.64,1:08:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not join the team if you want to pong?
Dialogue: 69,1:08:34.76,1:08:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Trying to donate your youth allowance?
Dialogue: 69,1:08:40.62,1:08:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They lost 4 points in a row.
Dialogue: 69,1:08:42.90,1:08:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Lin High that much better?
Dialogue: 69,1:08:45.33,1:08:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If Ding Xiao doesn't pose a threat, then we don't stand a ghost of a chance.
Dialogue: 69,1:08:49.15,1:08:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to all the excitement when Coach was talking about BBQ?
Dialogue: 69,1:08:52.52,1:08:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kinda hard to get in the mood.
Dialogue: 69,1:08:56.87,1:08:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget something?{yea her bat??}
Dialogue: 69,1:09:00.85,1:09:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You said I made a good shot before, right?
Dialogue: 69,1:09:07.22,1:09:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 69,1:09:10.68,1:09:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose anymore.
Dialogue: 69,1:09:13.82,1:09:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody can win every match.
Dialogue: 69,1:09:18.53,1:09:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes Lin High.
Dialogue: 69,1:09:27.63,1:09:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You in?
Dialogue: 69,1:09:32.56,1:09:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're winning this.
Dialogue: 69,1:09:37.66,1:09:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,1:09:39.58,1:09:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's swap. Thanks.{cheating??}
Dialogue: 69,1:09:42.11,1:09:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this. I believe in you.
Dialogue: 69,1:09:42.80,1:09:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for getting you mixed up in this.
Dialogue: 69,1:09:44.87,1:09:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You better be.
Dialogue: 69,1:09:46.85,1:09:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 69,1:09:49.08,1:09:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally some sauce on this snag.
Dialogue: 69,1:09:51.94,1:09:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a timeout?
Dialogue: 69,1:09:53.74,1:09:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're good. It's just a practice match.
Dialogue: 69,1:10:09.02,1:10:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time they've paired up, isn't it?
Dialogue: 69,1:10:11.51,1:10:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both good players. They'll be right... I think.
Dialogue: 69,1:10:24.78,1:10:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 69,1:10:25.54,1:10:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, not bad.
Dialogue: 69,1:10:27.46,1:10:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They got the first point, this looks promising!
Dialogue: 69,1:10:43.15,1:10:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 69,1:10:44.86,1:10:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 69,1:10:45.76,1:10:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They might win this!
Dialogue: 69,1:10:47.27,1:10:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you guys are just like Lu's three stooges.
Dialogue: 69,1:10:50.29,1:10:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 69,1:10:51.21,1:10:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They've probably finished warming up by now.
Dialogue: 69,1:10:56.00,1:10:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Long Shao.
Dialogue: 69,1:10:57.12,1:11:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yessiree, time to pull out the big guns.
Dialogue: 69,1:11:05.57,1:11:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on headband.
Dialogue: 69,1:11:17.43,1:11:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a fast attacker, and has great placement.
Dialogue: 69,1:11:22.63,1:11:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 69,1:11:28.03,1:11:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Luzza, remember all the times I had you bawling like an ankle biter?
Dialogue: 69,1:11:31.36,1:11:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it!
Dialogue: 69,1:11:32.52,1:11:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 69,1:11:43.55,1:11:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl knows Wang Lu's playstyle inside out.
Dialogue: 69,1:11:46.50,1:11:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 69,1:11:48.85,1:11:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She's targeting Wang Lu's backhand.
Dialogue: 69,1:11:51.75,1:11:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Her low quality returns affect Ruozhi as well.
Dialogue: 69,1:12:04.18,1:12:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me give you some advice.
Dialogue: 69,1:12:05.89,1:12:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're using too much wrist.
Dialogue: 69,1:12:07.49,1:12:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only get so far with a good forehand.
Dialogue: 69,1:12:11.42,1:12:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't help you in a real match.
Dialogue: 69,1:12:28.03,1:12:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the first time they've paired up, so they're not synced up as well as their opponents.
Dialogue: 69,1:12:32.58,1:12:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks bad.
Dialogue: 69,1:12:57.90,1:13:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They're completely on the back foot.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:00.21,1:13:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That tall girl isn't even playing seriously.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:04.00,1:13:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't improved one bit, Luzza.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:07.58,1:13:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you there's no point in flashy performances. \NYou should've just practised.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:11.06,1:13:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such an attention whore.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:13.00,1:13:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you calling an attention whore?
Dialogue: 69,1:13:14.87,1:13:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, don't get mad just cause I hit the bullseye.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:18.74,1:13:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave it at that for today.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:20.62,1:13:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Zhang Ruozhi.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:22.22,1:13:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you at the interleague.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:25.54,1:13:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:32.43,1:13:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:38.73,1:13:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet...
Dialogue: 69,1:13:40.68,1:13:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to decide when we're done playing.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:43.86,1:13:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we were trying to be nice.
Dialogue: 69,1:13:46.21,1:13:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Wang Lu! Good luck, Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,1:13:48.40,1:13:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you can take down Lin High!
Dialogue: 69,1:13:54.75,1:13:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Howzat?!
Dialogue: 69,1:13:59.41,1:14:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 69,1:14:05.65,1:14:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu's positioning has gotten a lot better!
Dialogue: 69,1:14:08.10,1:14:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared now, shrimpo?
Dialogue: 69,1:14:11.16,1:14:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get big heads. It was just a fluke.
Dialogue: 69,1:14:13.18,1:14:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow 'em outta the water!
Dialogue: 69,1:14:25.57,1:14:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Good stuff!
Dialogue: 69,1:14:38.70,1:14:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Persistent bastards.
Dialogue: 69,1:14:40.13,1:14:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see you return this!
Dialogue: 69,1:14:46.38,1:14:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody beats Qiming!
Dialogue: 69,1:14:48.35,1:14:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it steady!
Dialogue: 69,1:14:48.82,1:14:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 69,1:14:49.88,1:14:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 69,1:14:55.41,1:14:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I kinda got a little worked up there!
Dialogue: 69,1:14:59.68,1:15:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Pot calling the kettle black.
Dialogue: 69,1:15:02.53,1:15:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's ride this flow all the way.
Dialogue: 69,1:15:34.76,1:15:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 69,1:15:35.74,1:15:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 69,1:15:39.97,1:15:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They're tied again! How many times does that make it?
Dialogue: 69,1:15:42.35,1:15:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take my eyes off the game.
Dialogue: 69,1:15:45.10,1:15:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They can definitely win this!
Dialogue: 69,1:15:48.61,1:15:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu, Zhang Ruozhi! Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 69,1:15:49.76,1:15:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 69,1:15:52.07,1:15:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Smash 'em to bits!
Dialogue: 69,1:16:08.57,1:16:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!{x4}
Dialogue: 69,1:16:11.13,1:16:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let up!
Dialogue: 69,1:16:13.13,1:16:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Qiming!
Dialogue: 69,1:16:13.53,1:16:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, Ruozhi! Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,1:16:16.13,1:16:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanru, faito!
Dialogue: 69,1:16:17.15,1:16:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 69,1:16:23.34,1:16:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just one more point.
Dialogue: 69,1:16:25.06,1:16:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They can do this.
Dialogue: 69,1:16:43.70,1:16:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 69,1:16:44.77,1:16:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 69,1:16:45.79,1:16:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers, luv!
Dialogue: 69,1:17:05.19,1:17:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 69,1:17:31.54,1:17:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit it back!
Dialogue: 69,1:18:21.26,1:18:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it! We won!
Dialogue: 69,1:18:24.43,1:18:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! We beat Lin High!
Dialogue: 69,1:18:27.26,1:18:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are amazing!
Dialogue: 69,1:18:30.23,1:18:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the best!
Dialogue: 69,1:18:32.80,1:18:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not who I used to be, Long Shao!
Dialogue: 69,1:18:36.81,1:18:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win at the interleague!
Dialogue: 69,1:18:41.64,1:18:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop actin' like ya swept the floor with us!
Dialogue: 69,1:18:44.20,1:18:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you get on your knees and beg for forgiveness!
Dialogue: 69,1:18:46.27,1:18:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on!
Dialogue: 69,1:18:47.67,1:18:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd be scared of a cringelord like you?
Dialogue: 69,1:18:50.66,1:18:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We get it, let's get going.
Dialogue: 69,1:18:53.51,1:18:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach is waiting for us.
Dialogue: 69,1:18:57.90,1:19:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to the interleague.
Dialogue: 69,1:19:00.73,1:19:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nazza, get your mitts off me!
Dialogue: 69,1:19:03.20,1:19:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done sooking!
Dialogue: 69,1:19:06.19,1:19:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey—
Dialogue: 69,1:19:07.09,1:19:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That comeback was amazing!
Dialogue: 69,1:19:09.80,1:19:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a great last shot, Wang Lu.
Dialogue: 69,1:19:12.48,1:19:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to practising together.
Dialogue: 69,1:19:14.54,1:19:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Practice? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 69,1:19:17.54,1:19:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win at the interleague!
Dialogue: 69,1:19:20.51,1:19:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take that as a club application.
Dialogue: 69,1:19:24.86,1:19:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 69,1:19:27.32,1:19:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't wait to put meat in my mouth.
Dialogue: 69,1:19:28.94,1:19:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not serious, right?
Dialogue: 69,1:19:30.88,1:19:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we should celebrate!
Dialogue: 69,1:19:33.12,1:19:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me something to eat, I won some points too.
Dialogue: 69,1:19:35.76,1:19:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 69,1:19:41.87,1:19:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My family's waiting for me.
Dialogue: 69,1:19:44.24,1:19:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 69,1:19:49.59,1:19:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that last one.
Dialogue: 69,1:19:56.05,1:19:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 69,1:19:57.59,1:19:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Practice that backhand, yeah?
Dialogue: 69,1:20:03.82,1:20:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you bitch!
Dialogue: 69,1:20:11.91,1:20:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, she really did fall into my lap.
Dialogue: 69,1:20:15.37,1:20:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How cool am I?
Dialogue: 69,1:20:17.78,1:20:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember you doing anything, Coach.
Dialogue: 69,1:20:22.10,1:20:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the chat so I rushed out, but my bike's tire was punctured!
Dialogue: 69,1:20:26.09,1:20:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time I got there, everyone had left!
Dialogue: 69,1:20:31.00,1:20:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Wang Lu went to get lessons.
Dialogue: 69,1:20:34.51,1:20:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to help out my buddy's club.
Dialogue: 69,1:20:37.62,1:20:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! You were testing Wang Lu?
Dialogue: 69,1:20:40.04,1:20:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 69,1:20:43.34,1:20:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But I knew if she really liked ping pong, then she'd join us eventually.
Dialogue: 69,1:20:50.43,1:20:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the PR to us.
Dialogue: 69,1:20:55.21,1:20:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get a gorillion followers!
Dialogue: 69,1:20:57.36,1:20:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Trending on the front page!
Dialogue: 69,1:20:59.34,1:21:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, thanks.
Dialogue: 69,1:21:01.52,1:21:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not paying you, all right?
Dialogue: 69,1:21:03.34,1:21:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we know how much you like to pinch pennies, Captain.
Dialogue: 69,1:21:08.28,1:21:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounded like you almost said what you actually thought.
Dialogue: 69,1:21:10.83,1:21:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:12.95,1:21:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like everyone's here. Let's take a photo.
Dialogue: 69,1:21:15.09,1:21:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need to make a record of us setting sail on the great blue sea!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:21.75,1:21:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop goofing around, Ding Xiao!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:24.69,1:21:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:26.43,1:21:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:27.39,1:21:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:28.32,1:21:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:29.36,1:21:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ping pong!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:42.39,1:21:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Lu, you have some party tricks up your sleeve don't you?
Dialogue: 69,1:21:45.44,1:21:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for fun. What of it?
Dialogue: 69,1:21:47.70,1:21:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can give you a run for your money.
Dialogue: 69,1:21:49.54,1:21:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks exciting.
Dialogue: 69,1:21:50.65,1:21:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi Ruozhi!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:52.05,1:21:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,These are your teammates right? I'll treat you all to dinner.
Dialogue: 69,1:21:54.52,1:21:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Authentic Dongbei cuisine!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:57.65,1:21:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, wait!
Dialogue: 69,1:21:59.10,1:22:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah! Free food!
Dialogue: 69,1:22:02.60,1:22:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my first time going to a friend's house!
Dialogue: 69,1:22:04.77,1:22:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring some snacks!
Dialogue: 69,1:22:07.27,1:22:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I'll take you up on that.
Dialogue: 69,1:22:18.47,1:22:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Delish!
Dialogue: 69,1:22:19.61,1:22:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme summa this too!
Dialogue: 69,1:22:24.85,1:22:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad!
Dialogue: 69,1:22:29.13,1:22:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do!
Dialogue: 69,1:22:37.92,1:22:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let me finish taking photos.
Dialogue: 69,1:22:39.97,1:22:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to try some?
Dialogue: 69,1:22:41.78,1:22:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 69,1:22:42.10,1:22:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 69,1:22:51.25,1:22:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I joined the ping pong club.
Dialogue: 69,1:22:52.86,1:22:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Rest of this is mine!
Dialogue: 69,1:22:53.54,1:22:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're having dinner together at my place right now.
Dialogue: 69,1:22:57.30,1:22:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll do my best at the interleague.
Dialogue: 69,1:23:12.64,1:23:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The brilliance of table tennis is like a flash of white lightning.
Dialogue: 69,1:23:20.98,1:23:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd lost the spark once.
Dialogue: 69,1:23:23.58,1:23:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, I'm taking it back.
Dialogue: 69,1:23:37.78,1:23:37.83,Default,chapter,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.78,1:23:45.01,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's serve our rising heartbeats to the heavens
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.01,1:23:48.74,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Embrace each other with a smile
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.74,1:23:57.19,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The colour of our dreams will never fade
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.38,1:24:16.31,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Left to my thoughts counting my regrets
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.31,1:24:19.70,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I started to feel a little torn
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.70,1:24:25.76,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Can grit be a special talent?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.76,1:24:31.66,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Getting knocked down taught me how to stand strong
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.66,1:24:35.07,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Our bonds forged by passion
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.07,1:24:41.43,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Tempered us into comrades
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.43,1:24:48.96,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Where did our sweat-drenched adolescence get us?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.96,1:24:56.84,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wonder if we missed anything in our shared fixation
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.84,1:25:03.69,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's serve our rising heartbeats to the heavens
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.69,1:25:11.50,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's cry out as we remember where we're aiming for
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.50,1:25:12.81,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Never give up
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.81,1:25:20.94,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Even through the tears if I've got you we can go anywhere
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.94,1:25:28.77,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's connect our unfaded dreams through love
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.77,1:25:42.23,songs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,5000)}Let's embrace our pure white dream
